    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf8 <strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the chilling events of the first game, a new Playcenter Places opens its doors. Abandoned. Decaying. And not quite empty.<br>You play as a former employee trapped inside Experimentation Center \u2014 a place where toys aren\u2019t just playthings anymore\u2026 but living entities twisted by a sinister force. Prepare for a new descent into madness, where every hallway could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Story</strong>: Dive into an all-new chapter of <i>The Last Joy</i> universe. Meet fresh characters, uncover hidden lore, and unravel terrifying secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Mascots</strong>: Face a new generation of terrifying mascots and good friends \u2014 giant, living toys with unpredictable behavior and haunting designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong>: Roam a massive, interconnected facility filled with colorful zones \u2014 playful in appearance, deadly in nature. Every room tells a story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Tension</strong>: Manage your limited resources, craft makeshift weapons, and survive enemies that react to your sound and movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Gameplay</strong>: Each area introduces new mechanics \u2014 from stealth and puzzle-solving to adrenaline-pumping chase sequences.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf8 <strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the chilling events of the first game, a new Playcenter Places opens its doors. Abandoned. Decaying. And not quite empty.<br>You play as a former employee trapped inside Experimentation Center \u2014 a place where toys aren\u2019t just playthings anymore\u2026 but living entities twisted by a sinister force. Prepare for a new descent into madness, where every hallway could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Story</strong>: Dive into an all-new chapter of <i>The Last Joy</i> universe. Meet fresh characters, uncover hidden lore, and unravel terrifying secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Mascots</strong>: Face a new generation of terrifying mascots and good friends \u2014 giant, living toys with unpredictable behavior and haunting designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration</strong>: Roam a massive, interconnected facility filled with colorful zones \u2014 playful in appearance, deadly in nature. Every room tells a story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Tension</strong>: Manage your limited resources, craft makeshift weapons, and survive enemies that react to your sound and movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Gameplay</strong>: Each area introduces new mechanics \u2014 from stealth and puzzle-solving to adrenaline-pumping chase sequences.</p></li></ul>",
